Error [E3305]: `core.net.unix_listen` is not available for target `wasm32-wasip2`.
  --> tests/ui/wasip2_unsupported_socket_operation_e3305.jet:2:5
    |
  2 | use core.net as net
    |     ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The selected target has no Prelude adapter for `core.net.unix_listen`; WASI Preview 2 provides TCP/UDP sockets but not this operation.
 Fix: Use a supported TCP/UDP operation, or build for a native target.
